# JARVIS engine runtime data: the SQLite DB (conversations, memories, and
# the DPAPI-encrypted plugin_credentials table) and the ChromaDB store.
#
# `**/` because DB_PATH is the RELATIVE "data/jarvis.db", so the directory
# lands wherever the engine was started from:
#   services/jarvis-engine/data/       - started from the service root
#   services/jarvis-engine/src/data/   - started from src/
# The old pattern pinned the first path only, so the second was tracked by
# accident in a8908af9, Google OAuth tokens included.
#
# Deliberately scoped to the engine rather than a repo-wide **/data/ -
# apps/desktop/src/data/ holds real source files (currentModels.ts,
# graphHubs.ts) that must stay tracked.
services/jarvis-engine/**/data/